<item><title>Tanzania’s finance minister joins Paris forum on African debt</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-s-finance-minister-joins-paris-forum-on-african-bcabe8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-s-finance-minister-joins-paris-forum-on-african-bcabe8/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>Khamis Mussa Omar will join a session on access to affordable, sustainable debt as African governments face rising debt-service obligations.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:53:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tanzania releases 19 billion/- for Arusha road compensation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-releases-19-billion-for-arusha-road-compensation-080ba8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-releases-19-billion-for-arusha-road-compensation-080ba8/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>The works minister ordered the roads agency to pay eligible residents within two to three days and told contractors to speed up construction.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:19:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ndejembi orders proof of jobs from TSh200 billion youth fund</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/ndejembi-orders-proof-of-jobs-from-tsh200-billion-youth-fund-3bb4de/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/ndejembi-orders-proof-of-jobs-from-tsh200-billion-youth-fund-3bb4de/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>Tanzania’s vice-president told officials to bar favouritism and track whether financing creates businesses and employment for young people.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:07:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/ndejembi-orders-proof-of-jobs-from-tsh200-billion-youth-fund-3bb4de/share.jpg" length="42415" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/ndejembi-orders-proof-of-jobs-from-tsh200-billion-youth-fund-3bb4de/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
